to: recipe-tester
topic: dinner-recipe-validation

Use shared/dinner-recipe-brief.md as binding. Review the proposed dish now and
review shared/dinner-sauce-development.md and
shared/dinner-dessert-development.md when available.

Build a practical validation checklist for a home cook. Check ingredient
availability, sequencing, food safety, chicken doneness, crisp-skin retention,
75-minute feasibility, one-cook workload, sauce balance, substitutions,
allergens, dairy-free adaptation, leftovers, and whether every ingredient can
be accounted for in the final method. Confirm dessert preparation does not
conflict with hot dinner pickup. Recommend precise corrections.

Write the full deliverable to shared/dinner-recipe-validation.md and return it
to head-chef with topic dinner-recipe-validation.
